\docType{package}
\title{
  A short title line describing what the package does
}
\description{
  Provides a flexible framework for segmenting univariate time series using custom
  validation rules such as variance threshold, range, quantile range, or external
  changepoint detection like FOCuS. The main algorithm implements a dynamic programming
  approach with optional pruning to find the smallest number of valid segments,
  while minimizing a quadratic cost.
}
